From 20c878c2cf370b374254ad3efc9b1958cfc4e387 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: irvan-putra <irvan.putra@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:30:32 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Add DeltaChat queue transport (app side, gated off)

- dc_transport.py: explicit-only provisioning, fetch_queue with
  partial-failure targeted retry, send_result with per-page captions,
  send_summary, record_queue_outcome; a partial queue failure never
  marks the whole queue served, only failed page ids are retried
- DcQueueTransport: Kotlin/Chaquopy bridge with finishRun hook
- SetupController: pairing state; the chatmail account is created only
  by an explicit setup action, never on first launch
- MainActivity: setup section; auto-run on open once paired
- CaptureRunner reports failed page ids for targeted retry
- README: transport status wording; add .gitignore

Transport stays disabled until pairing is configured.
